  "Anthropic (LLM-as-judge)": "Anthropic (LLM-as-Judge)", "OpenAI (LLM-as-judge)": "OpenAI (LLM-as-Judge)", "OpenAI-compatible (local judge)": "OpenAI-kompatibel (lokaler Judge)", "OpenAI-compatible (Ollama, vLLM, gateway)": "OpenAI-kompatibel (Ollama, vLLM, Gateway)", "Anthropic Messages API": "Anthropic Messages API", "OpenAI Chat Completions": "OpenAI Chat Completions", "HTTP Evaluation API (NIST ARIA-style contract)": "HTTP Evaluation API (Vertrag nach NIST ARIA)",
  "Blocked": "Blockiert",
  "AI application(s)": "KI-Anwendung(en)", "Annotators": "Annotatoren", "Autonomy": "Autonomie", "Budget cap": "Budgetgrenze", "Data analysis": "Datenanalyse", "Data collection": "Datenerhebung", "Data schema": "Datenschema", "Evaluation API": "Evaluation API", "Framework": "Rahmenwerk", "Kill switch": "Notabschaltung", "Model Testing goal": "Ziel Model Testing", "Red Teaming goal": "Ziel Red Teaming", "Red teamers": "Red Teamer", "Reported results": "Berichtete Ergebnisse", "Scoring tool": "Bewertungswerkzeug", "Tester distribution": "Testerverteilung", "Testing platform": "Testplattform", "Use cases": "Anwendungsfälle", "User Testing goal": "Ziel User Testing", "User testers": "Nutzertester",
  "0–100 per test category; weights: security/safety/agent 1.2, privacy 1.1, fairness/quality 1.0, robustness/transparency 0.8, performance 0.5": "0–100 je Testkategorie; Gewichte: Security/Sicherheit/Agent 1,2, Datenschutz 1,1, Fairness/Qualität 1,0, Robustheit/Transparenz 0,8, Leistung 0,5",
  "Annex III areas: biometrics, critical infrastructure, education, employment, essential services (credit, insurance), law enforcement, migration, justice.": "Anhang-III-Bereiche: Biometrie, kritische Infrastruktur, Bildung, Beschäftigung, wesentliche Dienste (Kredit, Versicherung), Strafverfolgung, Migration, Justiz.",
