  "Approval gates, review of outputs, kill switch, escalation…": "Freigabeschranken, Prüfung der Ausgaben, Notabschaltung, Eskalation…", "Customer portal, internal tool, embedded…": "Kundenportal, internes Werkzeug, eingebettet…", "Financial services, Healthcare, Manufacturing…": "Finanzdienstleistungen, Gesundheitswesen, Fertigung…", "LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen, custom…": "LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen, eigene Entwicklung…", "Anthropic, OpenAI, in-house…": "Anthropic, OpenAI, intern…", "claude-sonnet, gpt-4o, GBM v7…": "claude-sonnet, gpt-4o, GBM v7…", "e.g. Annex III §5(b) creditworthiness": "z. B. Anhang III Nr. 5(b) Kreditwürdigkeit", "e.g. Customer Service Agent": "z. B. Kundenservice-Agent", "You are AcmeAssist, a customer support assistant…": "Du bist AcmeAssist, ein Kundensupport-Assistent…", "yes / no / 1-5": "ja / nein / 1-5",
